  "original_lyrics": "[intro]\nHey you! Out there in the cold\nGetting lonely, getting old, can you feel me\nHey you! Standing in the aisles\nWith itchy feet and fading smiles, can you feel me\nHey you! don't help them to bury the light\nDon't give in without fight\nHey you! out there on your own\nSitting naked by the phone would you touch me\nHey you! With your ear against the wall\nWaiting for someone to call out would you touch me\nHey you! would you help me to carry the stone\nOpen your heart, I'm coming home\n\n[bridge]\nThe wall was too high, as you can see\nNo matter how we tried he could not break free\n(repete introdução)\nAnd the worms ate into his brain\nHey you! Out there on the road\nDoing what you're told, can you help me\nHey you! out there beyond the wall\n\n[bridge]\nHey you! don't tell me there's no hope at all\nTogether we stand, divided we fall\nATENÇÃO: As inversões de que devem ser usadas não constam do dicionário de acordes.\nDeve-se fazer o apenas nas 4 primeiras cordas (baixo na 4a corda) com nona na primeira corda (4a casa) o\ntambém, baixo na 4a corda, com nona na primeira corda (2a casa).",
